{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At its core, JOLT takes the familiar brick breaker formula and supercharges it. You control a bouncing Ball that shatters everything in its path, while using the <strong>Jolt ability</strong> to bend its trajectory and line up the <strong>perfect shot</strong>. Each stage fills the screen with glowing Bricks, chain reactions, and <strong>explosive combos</strong> that grow more chaotic as you progress.<br><br><br><u><strong>ABILITIES</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/3f47ed429c40275fc8dccb2a77d18855.poster.avif?t=1774577156\" width=812 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/3f47ed429c40275fc8dccb2a77d18855.webm?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/3f47ed429c40275fc8dccb2a77d18855.mp4?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase through Bricks, deploy multi-balls, ... Unleash your abilities to <strong>bend the rules of physics</strong> and vaporize entire waves of Bricks in seconds. Each Ability can be upgraded permanently and during Stages.<br><br><br> <strong><u>GADGETS</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f50c0f94e15ee7eb732317db0a0504bd.poster.avif?t=1774577156\" width=854 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f50c0f94e15ee7eb732317db0a0504bd.webm?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f50c0f94e15ee7eb732317db0a0504bd.mp4?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Equip passive damage-dealing Gadgets to support your <strong>Brick-crushing mayhem</strong> with fire, electricity and acid. <br>Swap Gadget mods anytime to adapt to the situation and optimize your build.<br><br><br><br><strong><u>UPGRADES</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.poster.avif?t=1774577156\" width=958 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.webm?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/extras/f4052184c69b5b0ea07029b39f21c96f.mp4?t=1774577156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Between Stages, you invest  to upgrade the Ball, making it faster, stronger, and more destructive. As the invasion intensifies, you\u2019ll unlock new Abilities and Gadgets that completely change how you play \u2014 from precision control to <strong>screen-clearing blasts</strong>.<br><br> <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985100?t=1774577156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/ab1a5cf0294738b095c666e553a49c9ecca5af7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774577156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/6d77c09daff342e445a0139fb6e92f63a602f9cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774577156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985100/6d77c09daff342e445a0139fb6e92f63a602f9cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774577156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","